### Requisições para testar a API à mão (IntelliJ HTTP Client ou extensão REST Client do VS Code).
### Comece pelo cadastro e pelo login, e cole o accessToken devolvido em @token (ele vale 15 minutos).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@token = cole-aqui-o-accessToken-devolvido-no-login
@refreshToken = cole-aqui-o-refreshToken-devolvido-no-login
@projectId = cole-aqui-o-id-devolvido-na-criacao
@taskId = cole-aqui-o-id-devolvido-na-criacao

### Cadastro (201; repetir o mesmo e-mail dá 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@exemplo.com",
  "name": "Ana Lima",
  "password": "uma-senha-longa"
}

### Login: devolve accessToken e refreshToken (401 com a senha errada)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@exemplo.com",
  "password": "uma-senha-longa"
}

### Renovar: troca o refreshToken por um par novo; o usado deixa de valer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Logout: revoga o refreshToken (sempre 204)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Sem token: 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects

### Saúde da aplicação
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Criar projeto
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Lançamento do site"
}

### Nome curto demais: 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "ab"
}

### Listar os meus projetos
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detalhar projeto
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Renomear projeto
PUT {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Lançamento do site 2.0"
}

### Criar tarefa
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Escrever os testes",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "dueDate": "2099-12-31"
}

### Listar tarefas: segunda página, só as de prioridade alta, prazo mais próximo primeiro
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks?priority=HIGH&sort=dueDate&page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar tarefas de um responsável com prazo até o fim do ano
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks?assigneeId={{user}}&dueTo=2099-12-31&sort=title,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ordenação desconhecida: 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks?sort=priority
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar etiqueta
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/labels
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "bug",
  "color": "#E11D48"
}

### Trocar as etiquetas da tarefa
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/labels
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "labelIds": ["{{labelId}}"]
}

### Comentar na tarefa
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "text": "Testei no ambiente de homologação e funcionou."
}

### Atribuir responsável
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/assignee
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "assigneeId": "{{user}}"
}

### Mover a tarefa
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}

### Pular etapa: 422 com ProblemDetail
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "status": "DONE"
}

### Excluir projeto
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Membros do projeto (qualquer membro vê)
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Adicionar membro pelo e-mail (só o dono; a pessoa precisa ter conta)
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/members
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "email": "bia@exemplo.com"
}
